### Authentication
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@pawcare.com", 
  "password": "password123" 
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### ----------------------------------------------------
### BILLING MODULE APIs
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 1. List all Invoices (with Pagination)
# @name listInvoices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/billing/invoices?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

> {%
    // Save the ID of the first invoice to use in subsequent requests
    if (response.body.data.content.length > 0) {
        client.global.set("invoice_id", response.body.data.content[0].id);
    }
%}


### 2. Get Invoice by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/billing/invoices/{{invoice_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### 3. Download Invoice PDF
# To view this properly, you should open the URL in a browser or 
# click "Save Response to File" if your HTTP client supports it.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/billing/invoices/{{invoice_id}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/pdf


### 4. Create a New Invoice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/billing/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PATIENT_UUID",
  "visitId": "REPLACE_WITH_VALID_VISIT_UUID",
  "items": [
    {
      "itemType": "SERVICE",
      "description": "General Checkup",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 100.00,
      "taxRate": 18.00
    },
    {
      "itemType": "PRODUCT",
      "description": "Painkillers",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 25.00,
      "taxRate": 12.00
    }
  ],
  "discount": 10.00,
  "dueDate": "2026-08-01"
}


### 5. Update an Invoice (Assuming it's not PAID yet)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/billing/invoices/{{invoice_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PAID"
}


### 6. Cancel an Invoice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/billing/invoices/{{invoice_id}}/cancel?reason=Client_requested_cancellation
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### 7. Get GST Report
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/billing/gst/report?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
